Theorem VF-comp: layered-stack composition — the stack catches the UNION of VF-1..VF-8 failure classes

  Preconditions:
    - This is the sec-09 composition theorem per the sec-09 success_criteria:
      the layered verification stack catches the UNION of the failure classes
      its constituent layers catch; a fix that passes one layer but regresses
      another is a correctness regression, not a partial win (per Annex E §AIMS + arc.md Verification Surface: "a fix that passes one layer but
      regresses another is a correctness regression").
    - Signature MemoryContract x ArcFunction -> Bool (the whole-stack verdict)
      per aims-proof/proofs/01-verification/Verification.proof. Discharged
      against the sec-01 Verification.proof sorry obligation.
    - Each constituent VF-N is proved by its own theorem (VF-1.proof through
      VF-8.proof); VF-comp composes them into the joined layered-stack claim.
    - depends-on every VF-N (the constituent verification layers): VF-1
      (structural), VF-2 (contract consistency), VF-3 (oracle), VF-4 (FIP),
      VF-5 (end-to-end mandate), VF-6 (agreement), VF-7 (active-rewrite), VF-8
      (universal coverage).

  Soundness property:
    Forall realized ArcFunction F with inferred MemoryContract C:

      (P1) Joined union: the layered stack ACCEPTS (F, C) iff EVERY constituent
           layer accepts — the stack catches the UNION of the per-layer failure
           classes. A fix that passes a strict SUBSET of the layers (e.g. passes
           VF-1 structural but regresses VF-4 FIP balance) is REJECTED by the
           stack, because some layer in the union catches the regressed class.

      (P2) Conjunction strength: VF-comp is EXACTLY as strong as the conjunction
           of its constituents — it holds iff every constituent VF-N discharges.
           It never gracious-accepts over a failing or missing premise. A
           dropped constituent leaves a failure class uncaught (a false-valid
           risk), so the coverage gate asserts the full layer count.

    VF-comp is the capstone of the sec-09 contribution: the proof that the AIMS
    verification stack, layer by layer and composed, catches every inconsistency
    class — structural well-formedness, contract consistency, oracle
    re-derivation, FIP certification, end-to-end completeness, contract-
    realization agreement, active-rewrite soundness, and universal rule coverage
    — and that no fix passing one layer while regressing another slips through.

  Proof obligation:
    Constructive discharge by the structural_induction engine via composition of
    all 8 discharged VF constituents (mirrors section_07::verify_pl_composition +
    section_08::verify_rl_composition).

    Part (P1/P2) — constituent composition:
      The verifier re-runs each of the 8 VF constituent verifiers (VF-1 through
      VF-8), asserts each returns Valid, AND models the union-of-failure-classes
      property: a fix passing a strict subset of layers (7 of 8, regressing
      VF-4) is REJECTED by the whole-stack verdict, and a fix passing every
      layer is accepted. Coverage gate: exactly 8 VF constituents discharged. A
      failing or missing constituent fails VF-comp (the joined claim is no
      stronger than its weakest premise).

    Engines dispatched:
      structural_induction (PRIMARY — section_09::verify_vf_composition;
        constituent re-run + Valid-assertion + union-semantics check + 8-count
        coverage gate; emits Fail on any non-discharging constituent, a
        union-semantics violation, or a count mismatch)
      refinement (SECONDARY — gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest VF row)
      rc_counting (SECONDARY — gracious-accept)
      interprocedural_summary (SECONDARY — gracious-accept)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_09 structural_induction engine discharges the layered-stack composition theorem VF-comp by composing all 8 discharged VF constituents (each re-run and asserted Valid) plus the union-of-failure-classes property (a fix passing 7 layers but regressing VF-4 is rejected; a fix passing every layer is accepted), with an 8-count coverage gate ensuring no layer is dropped — the joined proof that the AIMS verification stack catches the union of structural / contract / oracle / FIP / end-to-end / agreement / active-rewrite / coverage failure classes
